  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e20ce9f6737e6e845b50655fcc50fb57, type: 3}
  m_Name: DumbleDoorInteriorPermaYao
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  speakerName: Humbledor
  lines:
  - We are safe for now, but the villain is getting stronger.
  - This is the Map of Torvalds.
  - This enchanted map will show you the location of the GUARDIANS you must defeat.
  - 'You must travel to the blue marking on the map. '
  - Collect the spells, and return when you have them all.
  - Press the M key to access the map.
  - Your Journey... BEGINS.... NOW!
